              </div>
              <div class="s5-info-item">
                <span class="s5-info-label" id="txt-s5-l2">IKÄRYHMÄ</span>
                <span class="s5-info-value" id="txt-s5-v2">7–13<br>vuotiaat</span>
              </div>
              <div class="s5-info-item">
                <span class="s5-info-label" id="txt-s5-l3">HINTA</span>
